Any person can paste that one link into any AI system and ask it anything a=
bout this case. What happened at the picnic table. What the dispatch record=
 says. What each of you wrote, and when, and what you did not write. The sy=
stem follows the indexes to every
 letter, every response, and every recording, down to the transcripts thems=
elves.</div>
<div class=3D"elementToProof" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_Embe=
