A journalist, a legislator, a lawyer, an investigator, or any member of the=
 public can now examine this entire record in the time it takes to ask a qu=
estion and share a link.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;=
, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" cl=
ass=3D"elementToProof">
Nothing in it has changed. Your letters are preserved as you sent them. The=
 recordings are unedited. The analysis is labeled as analysis and is regene=
rable from the evidence, so anyone may check it against the source. I have =
added no claims and removed none
 of my own errors.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
